nes and complicated relationships while navigating a hectic workplace life filled with unexpected developments!With Only One Month Left, Work and Romance Spiral Out of Control!? You will take on the role of an IT worker who has just been betrayed in love and sudden","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T09:01:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067943408","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:19:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4219400-1845383656395705","game_id":"steam-4219400","kind":"announcement","title":"\"Ninpō! ~Shinobi Journey~\" Is Joining Steam Next Fest This October!","summary":"Hello, everyone!We are excited to announce that Ninpō! ~Shinobi Journey~ will be participating in Steam Next Fest this October!Play the free Demo and get an early look at a Japanese-style world filled with succubi and danger as you embark on an adventure with the seductive ninja Sana! Seductive Ninja Sana Takes on a High-Paying Mission! A horde of succubi from another world has invaded, throwing the human realm into chaos!Players will take on the role of Sana, a ninja from the Exorcist Guild, as","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T09:00:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656395705","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:19:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4219400-1844751498233603","game_id":"steam-4219400","kind":"announcement","title":"《Kung Fu Waifus》Is Joining Steam Next Fest This October!","summary":"Hello, everyone!We are excited to announce that Kung Fu Waifus will be participating in Steam Next Fest this October!Play the free Demo and step into a turbulent martial world, where you will meet the kung fu maiden Shinran and embark on an adventure filled with training, schemes, and steamy dual cultivation!Make Shinran the Supreme Master of the Martial World in 30 Days! You are the sole heir to the fallen heretical sect known as Nimbus Citadel. Just as you are preparing to sell the sect’s prop","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T09:00:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498233603","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:19:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4219400-1844115010496466","game_id":"steam-4219400","kind":"announcement","title":"Custodes of Elf Hearts Is Out Now!","summary":"This title features six beautiful elf girls, each waiting to meet the protagonist and form a deeper relationship with him. Beyond their sexy figures and distinctive personalities, each girl has her own unique kinks and charms. As the adventure and story unfold, players will gradually discover their true feelings, grow closer to them, and unlock increasingly intimate and daring adult events. Junior assassin in the organization ◇ ElenaA direct junior subordinate of the protagonist within the organ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T02:00:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010496466","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:19:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4219400-1843481262701111","game_id":"steam-4219400","kind":"announcement","title":"Custodes of Elf Hearts Launches on September 19!","summary":"Within the World Tree, where elves have lived for generations, the half-human, half-elf protagonist is a member of an underground organization active in its lower levels. For years, he has worked from the shadows to protect the peace of the slums beneath the great tree’s roots.However, a traitor emerges within the organization, and hordes of black sludge-like creatures begin to appear, relentlessly polluting and eroding the elves’ home.To resolve this crisis, the protagonist sets out on an adven","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T09:00:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701111","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:19:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4219400-1830163047258936","game_id":"steam-4219400","kind":"announcement","title":"\"Ninpō! ~Shinobi Journey~\" Store Page Live! Mission, reward... or temptation? ♥","summary":"Overview“ Ninpō! ~Shinobi Journey~ “ is a 3D action-adventure RPG.A horde of succubi from another world has invaded, throwing the human realm into chaos…!Join the seductive ninja Sana on her thrilling journey across a Japanese-style world ♥GameplayFull 3D Adventure × Stage ChallengesFight against the perverse succubi who seek to throw the world into chaos across fully 3D environments!Follow Sana’s journey and embark on a thrilling and seductive adventure.High-Quality 3D Animated H ScenesEnjoy ov","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-17T02:00:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047258936","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:19:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4219400-1830163047256339","game_id":"steam-4219400","kind":"announcement","title":"Stranger Maidens Please Protect Me! Out Now! A dangerous, intimate adventure!","summary":"A brand-new roguelite title developed by Volcanic Good Boy and published by LewdLoco. Stranger Maidens: Please Protect Me! is now available!【Story】You play as Joey, a loser who was traumatised by the loss of his father. One day you received a mysterious artefact left by your father, and you are determined to go on an adventu